<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Solar system price in Nigeria is not one number. It depends on the inverter size, the battery type and size, how many panels come with it, and whether installation is in the price. Published October 2026 package prices from Lagos sellers put a 3.5 kVA lithium system with panels at roughly N3.1 to N3.4 million, and a 5 kVA-class system with 10 kWh of lithium and panels at about N5 to N5.5 million.</p><p>Every figure on this page is named to the seller or publisher and dated, because a shop price is what one seller lists, not the price in Nigeria. Prices move with the naira, so use these to check a quote, never as a quote. This site is advertising for independent Nigerian solar installers and sells nothing itself, so call now on +234 809 000 0000 and ask for written quotes from independent installers for a <a href="/home-solar-installation/">home solar installation</a>.</p></div></div></section>
